    {
      "name": "Chat (Socket)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Socket Connect",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{wsUrl}}/socket.io/?token={{token}}&EIO=4&transport=websocket",
              "host": [
                "{{wsUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "socket.io",
                ""
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "EIO",
                  "value": "4"
                },
                {
                  "key": "transport",
                  "value": "websocket"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Handshake for socket.io. After connecting, emit events:\n- direct:subscribe { customerId, artisanId } (artisan must have an active request from the customer)\n- direct:message { customerId, artisanId, message, attachments? } (same restriction for artisan)\n- direct:block { customerId, artisanId, reason? }\n- direct:unblock { customerId, artisanId }\n- chat:subscribe { requestId }\n- chat:message { requestId, message }\nNote: chat actions and direct actions are blocked if either side blocked the other."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Requests (Socket)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Socket Connect (Requests)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{wsUrl}}/socket.io/?token={{token}}&EIO=4&transport=websocket",
              "host": [
                "{{wsUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "socket.io",
                ""
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "EIO",
                  "value": "4"
                },
                {
                  "key": "transport",
                  "value": "websocket"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Subscribe to request updates in real-time.\nRooms:\n- request:{requestId}\n- user:{userId} (auto joined by server)\nEvents emitted by server:\n- request:new\n- request:accepted\n- request:rejected\n- request:canceled\n- request:in_progress\n- request:completed\nPayload: { requestId, customerId, artisanId, status, cancelledBy? }\nClient should emit no extra events; just listen after connect."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
